    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 1,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~5 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~5 min</span>",
   "title": "Slice the scallions",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"3\">3 cups</span> thinly sliced",
     "name_html": "Scallions"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Peel with the edge of a spoon, slice thinly, cut into matchsticks, then <b>mince finely</b> — smaller bits bite less.</li><li>Measure <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"0.25\" data-s=\"0\">¼ cup</span></b>, no more, and add it to the scallions.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Mince the ginger — less than you think",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Mince the ginger finely — and use only ¼ cup.",
      "src": "illustrations/ginger-scallion-noodles/2-how1.webp?v=d378897e1a"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/ginger-scallion-noodles/2.webp?v=6f17eadec5",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~5 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~5 min</span>",
   "title": "Mince the ginger — less than you think",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"0.25\">¼ cup</span> finely minced",
     "name_html": "Fresh ginger"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat the oil in a small saucepan until it <b>shimmers</b> (about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"170\" data-s=\"0\">170 °C</span> — a scallion slice dropped in sizzles hard).</li><li>Pour it over the scallions and ginger. It sizzles and bubbles up — this takes the raw burn off the ginger.</li><li>Stir once.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium-high",
    "label_html": "<span>medium-high</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
