   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ cup</span>",
     "name_html": "Neutral oil (grapeseed)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Stir in:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>light soy sauce (usukuchi) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tsp</span></span></li><li>sherry vinegar <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.75\">¾ tsp</span></span></li><li>sugar <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span></span></li><li>toasted sesame oil <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tsp</span></span></li><li>salt <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tsp</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Leave it <b>15–20 minutes</b> for the flavours to settle, then taste and adjust the salt.</li><li>It keeps 2 days in the fridge; stir before using.</li></ul>",
