  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Toss each bowl of hot noodles with <b>5–6 tablespoons</b> of sauce until every strand is coated.</li><li>Top with a couple of:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>pickled cucumber <span class=\"amt\">a few slices</span></li><li>toasted nori <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"1\" data-f=\"sheet|sheets\" data-n=\"1\">1 sheet</span></span></li><li>extra sliced scallion <span class=\"amt\">a pinch</span></li></ul></li></ul>",
